44a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v.18a2 2 0 0 1-1 1.73l-.43.25a2 2 0 0 1-2 0l-.15-.08a2 2 0 0 0-2.73.73l-.22.38a2 2 0 0 0 .73 2.73l.15.1a2 2 0 0 1 1 1.72v.51a2 2 0 0 1-1 1.74l-.15.09a2 2 0 0 0-.73 2.73l.22.38a2 2 0 0 0 2.73.73l.15-.08a2 2 0 0 1 2 0l.43.25a2 2 0 0 1 1 1.73V20a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h.44a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-.18a2 2 0 0 1 1-1.73l.43-.25a2 2 0 0 1 2 0l.15.08a2 2 0 0 0 2.73-.73l.22-.39a2 2 0 0 0-.73-2.73l-.15-.08a2 2 0 0 1-1-1.74v-.5a2 2 0 0 1 1-1.74l.15-.09a2 2 0 0 0 .73-2.73l-.22-.38a2 2 0 0 0-2.73-.73l-.15.08a2 2 0 0 1-2 0l-.43-.25a2 2 0 0 1-1-1.73V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z" /><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3" /></symbol><symbol id="i-sun" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4" /><path d="M12 2v2M12 20v2M4.93 4.93l1.41 1.41M17.66 17.66l1.41 1.41M2 12h2M20 12h2M6.34 17.66l-1.41 1.41M19.07 4.93l-1.41 1.41" /></symbol><symbol id="i-moon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3a6 6 0 0 0 9 9 9 9 0 1 1-9-9Z" /></symbol><symbol id="i-external" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M15 3h6v6" /><path d="M10 14 21 3" /><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6" /></symbol><symbol id="i-clock" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" /><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14" /></symbol><symbol id="i-stamp" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 22h14" /><path d="M19.27 13.73A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 17.5 13h-11A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 4 15.5V17a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h14a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1.5c0-.66-.26-1.3-.73-1.77Z" /><path d="M14 13V8.5C14 7 15 7 15 5a3 3 0 0 0-6 0c0 2 1 2 1 3.5V13" /></symbol><symbol id="i-send" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m22 2-7 20-4-9-9-4Z" /><path d="M22 2 11 13" /></symbol><symbol id="i-stop" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="6" y="6" width="12" height="12" rx="1" /></symbol><symbol id="i-activity" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2" /></symbol><symbol id="i-gauge" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m12 14 4-4" /><path d="M3.34 19a10 10 0 1 1 17.32 0" /></symbol><symbol id="i-hourglass" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 22h14M5 2h14" /><path d="M17 22v-4.172a2 2 0 0 0-.586-1.414L12 12l