        </header>
        <main class="page" id="main" tabindex="-1">
          <header class="page-header">
    <div class="page-header__main">
      <p class="overline">Master</p>
      <h1 class="page-title">Hanse master</h1>
      <p class="page-description">Built-in assistant that configures and operates this Hanse instance.</p>
      <div class="page-meta"><span class="mono">stopped</span><span class="mono">apps/master</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="page-header__actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/chat?app=master&amp;project=hanse-master"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-message" /></svg>Open chat</a><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/projects/hanse-master/apps/master/settings"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-settings" /></svg>Settings</a></div>
  </header>
          <div class="page__body"><div class="watch-strip watch-strip--2">
      <div class="watch"><p class="watch__value"><span class="status" data-state="queued"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-clock" /></svg>Stopped</span></p><p class="watch__label">Runtime</p></div>
      <div class="watch"><p class="watch__value">app</p><p class="watch__label">Kind</p></div>
    </div>
    <section class="card section" aria-labelledby="master-card-title">
      <div class="card__head"><h2 class="card__title" id="master-card-title">Master agent</h2><span class="badge badge--mono">system</span></div>
      <div class="card__body stack--tight">
        <p class="small">The master runs as an isolated agent. It creates projects and applications, writes their instructions, changes non-secret settings, and starts or restarts application agents through its Hanse tools.</p>
        <p class="small">Its own directory is coordinator-managed and read-only inside its container. Its instructions are rewritten from the coordinator on every start.</p>
        <p class="small">Skills can be created, inspected, updated, enabled/disabled, and overridden from the master chat; deleting or renaming them stays operator-only. Provider keys, git credentials, image builds, and project deletion are operator-only UI actions.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card__foot"><a class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" href="/chat?app=master&amp;project=hanse-master"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-message" /></svg>Open chat</a><a class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" href="/projects/hanse-master/apps/master/settings"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-settings" /></svg>Application settings</a><a class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" href="/projects/hanse-master/apps/master/skills"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-code" /></svg>Skills</a></div>
    </section></div>
        </main>
      </div>
